      {
        "npc": "I am a poor, dispossessed nobleman, forced by circumstance to lurk in the middle of nowhere, soliciting help from passers-by."
      },
      {
        "npc": "You see, my fiendish half-brother has seized my estates and forced me into exile."
      },
      {
        "npc": "The simple lemon farmers suffer under his tyrannous yoke, and only a brave adventurer can lift his iron boot from the neck of the poor."
      },
      {
        "npc": "To reclaim my lands I will need to have my family sword returned to me so that I may present it as proof of my rulership."
      },
      {
        "npc": "Will you help me find my family sword?"
